Qwen Go is an independent native Go implementation of a Qwen-compatible coding client.
It is not the official Qwen Code release and is not affiliated with its maintainers.

Protocol/auth behavior was ported with reference to installed Qwen Code 0.24.5
(@qwen-code/qwen-code), distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
Its JavaScript source and Node.js runtime are not shipped in this executable.

Go terminal dependencies retain their respective licenses in their upstream modules.
